<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Redhook Ale downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Redhook Ale downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth analyst Diane Daggatt said she cut Redhook Ale Brewery Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the beer company were up 1 at 18.</p>
<p>--&quot;Despite our long-term favorable outlook for Redhook, we believe the shares are fully valued given near-term uncertainty and the current valuation at 26.6 times our next year's revised estimate,&quot; Daggatt said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
